<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<style>
  body { background: #f1f5f9; }
  .login-page { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .login-card {
    max-width: 420px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
  }
  .brand { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .brand h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; }
  .brand p  { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0; }
  .divider  { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 1.25rem 0; }
  .divider::before, .divider::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #e2e8f0; }
  .btn-google {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem;
    width: 100%; padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff; color: #374151; font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-google:hover { background: #f8fafc; color: #111; }
  .btn-google svg   { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .form-control { border-radius: 8px; }
  .btn-primary  { border-radius: 8px; width: 100%; }

  .pitch-eyebrow { color: #4f46e5; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .pitch-heading { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .pitch-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 560px; }
  .pitch-point { display: flex; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; max-width: 560px; }
  .pitch-point i { color: #4f46e5; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0.15rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .pitch-point-title { font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
  .pitch-point-note { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.55; }
</style>

<main class="login-page">
  <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
      <div class="pitch-heading">Executable Organisational Operating Platform</div>
      <h1 class="pitch-eyebrow">AI-native organisation, not an agent</h1>
      <p class="pitch-lead">
        Software has never been produced by individuals working alone. It is produced by organisations,
        with shared objectives, delegated authority, reviewed decisions, and knowledge that outlives any
        one person. As AI takes on more of the engineering lifecycle, the real risk is not the AI's
        capability. It is the absence of an organisation around it. This platform starts from an engineering
        Objective and assembles the Capabilities, roles, and Participants required to deliver it.
        Participants may be human, AI, or external systems, and the platform governs the work the same
        way regardless of who or what is doing it.
      </p>

      <div class="pitch-point">
        <i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i>
        <div>
          <div class="pitch-point-title">Nothing self-certifies</div>
          <div class="pitch-point-note">Finishing work is a proposal, not a fact — whether the Participant is human or AI, the same governance decides whether it actually takes effect.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pitch-point">
        <i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i>
        <div>
          <div class="pitch-point-title">Lifecycle is enforced, not decorative</div>
          <div class="pitch-point-note">Every Deliverable moves through a real, checked state graph. A legal transition with no evidence or approved decision behind it is rejected, not waved through.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pitch-point">
        <i class="bi bi-activity"></i>
        <div>
          <div class="pitch-point-title">Built and running, not just designed</div>
          <div class="pitch-point-note">The Software Engineering Unit (SEU) is a governed instance of an engineering organisation — proven on real end-to-end runs, not a proposal on paper.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-5">
      <div class="login-card mx-auto">
        <div class="brand">
          <h1><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow me-1 text-primary"></i>SEU Studio</h1>
          <p>SEU Commissioning Platform</p>
        </div>

        <% if (locals.error) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-danger py-2 small" role="alert"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (locals.info) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-info py-2 small" role="alert"><%= info %></div>
        <% } %>

        <% if (locals.googleEnabled) { %>
          <!-- <a href="/finanaly/auth/google" class="btn-google"> -->
          <a href="/aisworg/auth/google" class="btn-google">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z" fill="#4285F4"/>
              <path d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z" fill="#34A853"/>
              <path d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l2.85-2.22.81-.62z" fill="#FBBC05"/>
              <path d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z" fill="#EA4335"/>
            </svg>
            Continue with Google
          </a>
          <div class="divider">or sign in with email</div>
        <% } %>

        <!-- <form action="/finanaly/auth/login" method="POST"> -->
        <form action="/aisworg/auth/login" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <div class="mb-3">
            <label for="email" class="form-label small fw-semibold">Email</label>
            <input type="email" class="form-control" id="email" name="email" required autofocus autocomplete="email">
          </div>
          <div class="mb-4">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-baseline">
              <label for="password" class="form-label small fw-semibold">Password</label>
              <!-- <a href="/finanaly/auth/forgot-password" class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.8rem;">Forgot password?</a> -->
              <a href="/aisworg/auth/forgot-password" class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.8rem;">Forgot password?</a>
            </div>
            <input type="password" class="form-control" id="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password">
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Sign in</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
